{"unit_id":"Isilsolme__dsh-splash-launcher#card-zh","repo":"Isilsolme/dsh-splash-launcher","commit":"d3a0c4a9d7525ca1d8edc3e2280c7d86f4501101","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"这是一个面向 Windows 的 DSH Web GUI 启动器，同时提供可供 agent 调用的 desktop_launch 工具。启动时会打开带自绘标题栏的 WebView2 窗口，播放鲸鱼与 HARNESS 描边动画，并在后台启动 dsh web；服务就绪后在隐藏 iframe 中预载 GUI，再切换显示。它支持选择工作目录和端口、跟随 DSH 深浅色设置、记住窗口最大化状态，并在关闭时停止本次启动的服务。适合希望从桌面快速打开 DSH Web 界面或让 agent 代为启动 GUI 的 Windows 用户；需要 Windows、WebView2 Runtime 和已安装的 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-24","DSH-GUI.cs:178-218","DSH-GUI.cs:326-378","splash.html:426-467"]}
{"unit_id":"Isilsolme__dsh-splash-launcher#card-en","repo":"Isilsolme/dsh-splash-launcher","commit":"d3a0c4a9d7525ca1d8edc3e2280c7d86f4501101","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"A Windows launcher for the DSH Web GUI. It opens a WebView2 window with a whale and HARNESS startup animation while dsh web starts, then reveals the interface when ready. It supports workspace and port settings and provides agents a desktop_launch tool. Requires Windows, WebView2 Runtime, and DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-24","DSH-GUI.cs:178-218","DSH-GUI.cs:326-378","splash.html:426-467"]}
